<title>UK: Berne Union appoints Erling Napier new president.</title>
<headline>Berne Union appoints Erling Napier new president.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Erling Naper has been appointed president of the International Union of Credit and Investment Insurers (Berne Union), the organisation said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Naper has been vice president of the Berne Union since April 1995.</p>
<p>His appointment follows the death of former president Gerhard Praschak, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
